# Chuan hoa ket thuc dong.
#
# LY DO CU THE - do 2026-08-28:
#
# core.autocrlf=true tren may Windows nay nen ban lam viec co CRLF, con runner
# Linux checkout ra LF. evaluation/freeze.py bam BYTE THO (`path.read_bytes()`),
# nen cung mot noi dung cho hai ma bam khac nhau.
#
# Hau qua: test_eval_frozen bao "file da bi sua sau khi dong bang" cho ca v1,
# v2, v3 tren MOI lan chay CI - trong khi khong ai sua mot ky tu nao. Do la ly
# do CI do tu lan chay dau tien.
#
# Bo canh DEC-023 la thu chan viec sua tap kiem thu sau khi dong bang. Mot bo
# canh keu oan tren moi lan chay thi khong ai con doc no nua - va luc do mot
# lan sua that se di qua ma khong ai thay.

* text=auto

# Cac file duoi day duoc bam de kiem toan ven -> BAT BUOC LF o moi noi.
*.yaml   text eol=lf
*.yml    text eol=lf
*.json   text eol=lf
*.jsonl  text eol=lf
*.py     text eol=lf
*.md     text eol=lf
*.sql    text eol=lf

# Nhi phan - khong dung cham
*.pdf    binary
*.pptx   binary
*.docx   binary
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
